    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyAsk2Body": "Tap the microphone and speak. Your words appear as you talk, and you can send straight away.",
  "@storyAsk2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyAsk3Title": "You confirm every change",
  "@storyAsk3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyAsk3Body": "Ask it to add or update a record and it shows a card first. Nothing is saved until you confirm.",
  "@storyAsk3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyAsk4Title": "Undo any change",
  "@storyAsk4Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyAsk4Body": "Changed your mind? Every change you confirmed can be undone from the same card.",
  "@storyAsk4Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyAsk5Title": "Pick up where you left off",
  "@storyAsk5Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyAsk5Body": "Chats are kept for 90 days in Chat history, and suggested questions help you get started.",
  "@storyAsk5Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyWallet1Title": "Get ready first",
  "@storyWallet1Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyWallet1Body": "Open a card or document and choose where you keep it, such as your wallet or bag.",
  "@storyWallet1Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyWallet2Title": "Save the lost card number",
  "@storyWallet2Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyWallet2Body": "Add each bank's lost card number now. It is printed on the card, which is gone when you need it.",
  "@storyWallet2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyWallet3Title": "If it goes missing",
  "@storyWallet3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyWallet3Body": "Open Lost my wallet and tap Lost or Stolen. Vaultara lists everything that was inside.",
  "@storyWallet3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyWallet4Title": "Block cards in minutes",
  "@storyWallet4Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyWallet4Body": "Call each bank with one tap, mark cards as blocked and keep the police case number.",
  "@storyWallet4Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyWallet5Title": "Replace and stay safe",
  "@storyWallet5Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyWallet5Body": "Replace your documents, check your statements when reminded, and tap I found it if it turns up.",
  "@storyWallet5Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyLife1Title": "Big moments, one plan",
  "@storyLife1Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyLife1Body": "Moving, a baby, a new job or an emergency: choose what is happening in Life events.",
  "@storyLife1Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyLife2Title": "Your records, sorted",
  "@storyLife2Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyLife2Body": "The plan lists which records to update, cancel or renew, and which ones you may need to add.",
  "@storyLife2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyLife3Title": "Steps and dates",
  "@storyLife3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyLife3Body": "Steps cover what is not a record, and start-by dates tell you when to apply so nothing is late.",
  "@storyLife3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyLife4Title": "Make it yours",
  "@storyLife4Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyLife4Body": "Add your own steps, share the plan as a PDF and get reminders around the date.",
  "@storyLife4Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyPhotos1Title": "Photos of your documents",
  "@storyPhotos1Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyPhotos1Body": "Add photos of the front and back of a card or document from the record.",
  "@storyPhotos1Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyPhotos2Title": "Encrypted on your phone",
  "@storyPhotos2Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyPhotos2Body": "Turn on photo encryption and photos are locked on your phone before they are uploaded.",
  "@storyPhotos2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyPhotos3Title": "Lock sensitive records",
  "@storyPhotos3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyPhotos3Body": "Lock a record and it asks for your fingerprint or screen lock before it opens.",
  "@storyPhotos3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyPhotos4Title": "Lock the whole app",
  "@storyPhotos4Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyPhotos4Body": "In Security and privacy, turn on app lock and hide the app's content when you switch apps.",
  "@storyPhotos4Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyShare1Title": "Share one record",
  "@storyShare1Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyShare1Body": "Open a record and share a link that shows only that record, nothing else.",
  "@storyShare1Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyShare2Title": "Proof pack",
  "@storyShare2Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyShare2Body": "Put the records you choose, with their photos, into one PDF for a landlord, bank or office.",
  "@storyShare2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyShare3Title": "Stay in control",
  "@storyShare3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyShare3Body": "Shared links lists every link you made. Stop one at any time and it no longer opens.",
  "@storyShare3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyHousehold1Title": "Invite your household",
  "@storyHousehold1Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyHousehold1Body": "Share an invite code or link. Each person signs in with their own account.",
  "@storyHousehold1Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyHousehold2Title": "One set of records",
  "@storyHousehold2Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyHousehold2Body": "Everyone sees the same shared records and gets the same reminders.",
  "@storyHousehold2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyHousehold3Title": "Whose is it?",
  "@storyHousehold3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyHousehold3Body": "Each record can belong to someone. Their name shows on it and in its reminders.",
  "@storyHousehold3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyImport1Title": "Scan a card",
  "@storyImport1Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyImport1Body": "Snap a card or document and Vaultara fills in the name and expiry date for you.",
  "@storyImport1Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyImport2Title": "Import a list",
  "@storyImport2Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyImport2Body": "Keep a spreadsheet already? Import it and check each row before anything is saved.",
  "@storyImport2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyImport3Title": "Share into Vaultara",
  "@storyImport3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyImport3Body": "Share a photo, PDF or text from another app to Vaultara to start a new record.",
  "@storyImport3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyCosts1Title": "In your calendar",
  "@storyCosts1Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyCosts1Body": "Add expiry dates to your phone's calendar, so they sit next to your other plans.",
  "@storyCosts1Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyCosts2Title": "What renewals cost",
  "@storyCosts2Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyCosts2Body": "Add what a renewal costs to a record and Vaultara shows what you spend each year.",
  "@storyCosts2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyCosts3Title": "Plan ahead",
  "@storyCosts3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyCosts3Body": "See the expensive months coming, so a big renewal never takes you by surprise.",
  "@storyCosts3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyBusiness1Title": "Track your team",
  "@storyBusiness1Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyBusiness1Body": "Add staff and keep their certificates, permits and licences in one place.",
  "@storyBusiness1Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyBusiness2Title": "Email reminders",
  "@storyBusiness2Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyBusiness2Body": "Staff get email reminders before their documents expire, even without the app.",
  "@storyBusiness2Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyBusiness3Title": "Monthly report",
  "@storyBusiness3Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyBusiness3Body": "A report each month shows what is valid, what is expiring and what is missing.",
  "@storyBusiness3Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
  "storyBusiness4Title": "Request an update",
  "@storyBusiness4Title": {
    "description": "Title of a tutorial step. Short."
  },
  "storyBusiness4Body": "Send a link and staff can upload their renewed document themselves.",
  "@storyBusiness4Body": {
    "description": "Text of a tutorial step."
  },
